        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Analyze Incoming Incidents"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1781705164337"
          },
          "code": "ANALYZE_INCOMING_INCIDENTS",
          "id": "1767839500324",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767839500325_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "are given two JSON arrays:\n\nreportedIncidents: {{$context.$nodes.GET_REPORTED_INCIDENTS.$output.items}}\nEach item includes IncidentKey (unique incident key).\n\nincidentAiResults: {{$context.$nodes.GET_AI_RESULTS.$output.items}} \nEach item includes ResultId (incident key it relates to) \n\n\nGoal: Create and return one complete JSON array that contains every item from reportedIncidents, in the same order, with an added field AIContent and PrimaryAction\n\nMerge logic for AIContent:\n\nFor each reportedIncident:\n-Find an item in incidentAiResults where incidentAiResults.ResultId === reportedIncident.IncidentKey.\n-If found, set reportedIncident.AIContent = incidentAiResults.Content field\n-If not found, set reportedIncident.AIContent = null\n-remove field @context from the object\n-For any string field value that contains line breaks (multi-line text), do not output literal newlines inside the quotes. Instead, convert all line breaks to the escaped  newline sequence \\\\n (and if present, convert tabs to \\\\t).\n\nDerivation logic for PrimaryAction:\n\nFor each reportedIncident, set reportedIncident.PrimaryAction as follows:\n\n-If reportedIncident.AIContent is null (or missing), set:\nPrimaryAction = \"ORA_SCHEDULE\"\n-Otherwise, read reportedIncident.AIContent.RecommendedAction (array) and choose exactly one action using this precedence order (highest to lowest):\n\"ORA_DUPLICATE\"\n\"ORA_PRIORITY\"\n\"ORA_REROUTE\"\n\nHard requirements:\n\nOutput only valid JSON (no markdown, no commentary).\nOutput the entire merged array with all incidents. Do not truncate.\nReturn the full json array result."
            },
            {
              "id": "1767839500324_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            }
          ],
